1498 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Researcher and Interaction Designer \174 Tactical Tech \057 Berlin\054 Germany \050jul 2026 \055 ongoing\051\nResearch and design for The Toxic Triangle project\054 investigating the impact of technology on young people\nSupport of the research phase\054 and design of an interactive experience to communicate a systemic issue to a non\055technical audience \050specifically targeted to decision makers\051\n\nMentor \174 reDesignHer \057 full remote \050feb 2026 \055 apr 2026\051\nMentor cohort of middle and high school girls in virtual innovation program\nGuide students through design thinking processes and creative problem\055solving methods\nProvide weekly feedback on student projects addressing meaningful challenges\n\nUX\057UI Designer \174 DomaFlow \057 Lugano\054 Switzerland \057 hybrid \050feb 2026 \055 mar 2026\051\nCreated user flows\054 wireframes\054 and high\055fidelity prototypes for property management platform\nDesigned interface components and contributed to early\055stage design system development\nPerformed information architecture review and bug reporting\n\nResearch Intern \174 LeNSlab Polimi \057 Milan\054 Italy \050sep 2024 \055 jan 2025\051\nApplied UX design and user interface design to develop Ecodesign tool on Google Sheets\nConducted research on sustainability case studies and maintained LeNSlab website using WordPress\054 HTML\054 and CSS\n\nWeb Designer \174 Interdependence \055 Politecnico di Milano \057 Milan\054 Italy \050jan 2024 \055 apr 2024\051\nWeb design for Milan Design Week 2024 exhibition Interdependence\nImplemented interactive visual effects using JavaScript and p5\056js\n\nOther\n\137Web Designer \057 Anthropogenic Narratives \055 Polimi \100 Triennale Milano \050feb 2023 \055 mar 2023\051\n\137Exhibition coordinator \057 \034More than Human AI\035 \100 Polimi \050jan 2025\051\n\137Cultural mediator \057\240\035Surprise Party\072 carte blanche \340 Constance Guisset Studio\041\035 \100 MDW2023 \050apr 2023\051\n\137Peer\055to\055peer students tutor \057 Curve e superfici per il design \100 Polimi \050oct 2022 \055 jan 2023\051\n\137Social media manager \057 Dynamis PRC\240\050oct 2021 \055 apr 2022\051)
     /K [ 5 ]
